// The Tangled Burrow: the first dungeon, a short (about 3 minute) crawl
// through the roots under Whisperwood. Entered by the burrow mouth in the
// forest or from the dungeon board in Lanternhold.
//
// Layout, from the entrance (north) to the end (south):
//   Entrance hall (pups) -> the Matriarch's den -> a side tunnel (rot spores)
//   -> Mother Sporecap's grotto -> a tunnel (pups and a rot spore)
//   -> the Rotheart's chamber.
// The walls are solid boxes around each room and tunnel.
